# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# font.tomchen.org forwards every request here with its path unchanged (one
# Cloudflare redirect rule on the tomchen.org zone). Its docs lived at the
# same paths as ours minus the language prefix, and they were English only.
# /img/* and /bdfparser_fonts/* kept their paths and need no rule.
